repobar (0.0.0~git20260519) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging. Builds with --static-swift-stdlib so the
    .deb is self-contained for the Swift runtime; runtime dependencies
    are limited to standard GUI libraries already on every Ubuntu LTS.
  * Ships RepoBarGtk tray app, repobar CLI, .desktop entry, hicolor
    icon set, and the systemd --user unit from packaging slice #19.

